/**
 * The kinds of operations an annotation may apply to.
 *
 * - `'read'` — `SELECT` / `find` / `first` / `all` / `count` / aggregates.
 * - `'write'` — `INSERT` / `UPDATE` / `DELETE` / `create` / `update` / `delete` / `upsert`.
 *
